   "desc": "Monthly Meditation Hour: Take your yoga beyond the physical. In each session we will explore a different Meditation technique, exploring Pranayama (breathwork), Mudra (hand symbols), and Mantra (sound). First we will meet and share a few moments with tea and community. Then we will join together in practice for 30-40 minutes. After which, we will set aside time for reflection and introspection. This time can be spent sharing your experience, journaling or just quietly reflecting. If you'd like, bring a mug, a favorite tea bag, and a journal.",
