   "start": "12:00",
   "end": "13:30",
   "desc": "This one-hour workshop will explore menopause from both scientific and Ayurvedic perspectives. We will discuss what menopause is, the wide range of symptoms that can arise, and how to navigate this new phase of life with greater awareness and support. The session will also include gentle yoga practices designed to support the body, calm the mind, and help relieve some common symptoms. Whatever stage of menopause you may be in, this workshop will help you better understand and connect with where you are. One Hour Workshop $30",
